      {
        "Id": "b6b886d4cc8f40fa83a5940bd358fbf1",
        "Title": "CIVIL 3D - XY + Z EXPORT\n\nMultiple selection switch:\nTRUE = window/crossing-select alignments, profile views or layout profiles.\nAll layout profiles on each selected view's alignment are exported once.\nFALSE = click one layout profile curve (not the view grid).\n\nStation Interval:\n0 = critical stations, including curve boundaries and interior samples.\nPositive value = also add regularly spaced stations in metres.\n\nRun, select, then choose an output folder.\nEach profile produces XY and Z reports with actual profile entities.\nExisting same-name reports in the chosen folder are replaced.\nCancel selection or folder selection to stop without exporting.\n\nOutput: profile names, Z paths, XY paths, messages.\n\nWatch messages now show selection, skip reasons and named export errors.",
